  <dmn:decision id="_428EC775-E989-4EF3-ACDA-879F82AFAC31" name="checks">
    <dmn:description>Requires no current PhlRetip enrollment, Philadelphia residence, owner occupancy and the internal age-or-income check. The age route is applicant or live-in spouse age 65 as of today, with no late-spouse route; qualifying seniors need not satisfy the income route. Income, when used, is prepared under the City household-income guidance. The model does not calculate installments or enforce the March application deadline. Source checked 2026-10-17; the income table retains its recorded 2026-10-05 review. Named entries invoke reusable check Decision Services; inspect those models for their policy interpretation and input contract.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:extensionElements>
      <kie:attachment name="Philadelphia Real Estate Tax Installment Plan — senior and income routes" url="https://www.phila.gov/services/payments-assistance-taxes/payment-plans-and-assistance-programs/income-based-programs-for-residents/set-up-real-estate-tax-installment-plan/" />
    </dmn:extensionElements>
